<title>LATVIA: C.BANK KEEPS 31-DAY DEPOSIT RATE AT 1.5 PCT.</title>
<headline>C.BANK KEEPS 31-DAY DEPOSIT RATE AT 1.5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Monday said it would accept deposits for 31 days on May 12 at an unchanged 1.5 percent.</p>
<p>The previous rate cut was at the start of April, when the 31-day rate was reduced by 0.5 percent to the present level.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that the payment date for the new round of 31-day deposits is June 12.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
